attribute change). I haven't seen any works using it that way - the closest
I found was an example of checking for homophily vs. transitivity as the
cause of clustering.

I'd be grateful if you can tell me if disentangling selection vs influence
with longitudinal data in stergm is possible, and perhaps point me to
the specific effects might one include to accomplish that.

Best!
Inna
