Hi Jacob,

Your interpretation is right.  The only tweak I would make is that for 
cross-sectional ergms, it's more appropriate to talk about the log odds 
of ties existing, rather than forming.  We used to the latter term 
ourselves sometimes, but now with stergms out, we try to be more precise 
and talk about ties forming and dissolving in dynamic models, and ties 
existing in static models.

Thanks for sending such clear code - it makes helping out easy!

Yours,
Steve


