Hi, Jesse -

Your problem is that you fed gden a digraph.  Undirected graphs in sna 
are represented by fully mutual structures; setting mode="graph" is a 
way of telling sna routines that the data is symmetric, but in most 
cases does not force symmetrization of data.  (That's by design.)  If 
you symmetrize your input matrix, you will get the result you expect.

Hope that helps,

-Carter

