Dear Statnet group, 

this is a question about the STERGM.  I would like to know if and how it is possible to include stable and, eventually, even (externally) changing dyad covariates.  Say, for example, I would like to model the formation/dissolution of relationships among a small group of neighbors over several waves.  How could I include a term for whether people had known each other before the first wave?  And, ideally, how could I include a term for the (exogenously) changing distances between their work places?  Can STERGM handle any of this and, if so, how to best feed the model with the stable/changing matrices in R?

Thanks!

Achim
From weare at price.usc.edu  Wed Aug 27 12:40:07 2014
From: weare at price.usc.edu (Weare, Christopher)
