Subject: [statnet_help] ERGMS on multiple networks in XPNet
In-Reply-To: <20141017071304.919988knl1na15ts@umail.oit.umass.edu>
References: <20141016135846.20862exgmg6lrpli@umail.oit.umass.edu>
