but nothing between 1 and 5 made any substantial difference. The model 
fit according to AIC gets better the fewer dimensions there are.

- I get the following message during the estimation of the latent space 
model: "Burning in... Backing off: too few acceptances. If you see this 
message several times in a row, use a longer burnin. Finished." Since I 
get this message only once, I don't care about it. Should I? What does 
